# Build context for the web image is this directory (the root .dockerignore
# excludes `web/` entirely and does not apply here).
#
# The secret patterns below are deliberately WIDER than the repo .gitignore rather
# than a copy of it: this file decides what reaches an image layer, and a layer is
# published. `.env*` replaces three named spellings, and every pattern carries `**/`
# so a nested match is caught too — a Docker pattern without a slash matches the
# context root only. Closing the gap costs one prefix, and measuring whether anything
# currently sits in it cannot be done from a worktree: gitignored files are absent
# from a fresh checkout, so "none found" and "none visible" are the same result.

# Installed and built output — the image builds both itself.
node_modules/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tests and their artefacts — not in the image. The Playwright specs live under
# `tests/e2e/`, so `tests/` already covers them; there is no top-level `e2e/`.
tests/
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
.lighthouseci/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.mjs
vitest.config.ts
playwright.config.ts

# Secrets and local-only files — must never reach a layer.
**/.env*
**/*.local.ts
**/*.local.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Tooling and docs.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.md
lighthouserc*
scripts/visual-verify.ts

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
